WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Noura: Sierra 2, Sierra 2, this is Marshal 22, over.

2
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Sierra 2: Go ahead, over.

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Noura: Gate 4 soft ticket check.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Noura: A man with no ticket slipped past behind a family, heading to the security check point.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.500
Noura: Twenties, red cap, white thobe, black backpack.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.500
